<title>USA: Abercrombie &amp; Fitch opens sharply higher.</title>
<headline>Abercrombie &amp; Fitch opens sharply higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Abercrombie &amp; Fitch Co opened nearly 40 percent higher on Thursday in their Wall Street debut.</p>
<p>Trading in Abercrombie &amp; Fitch opened at a price of 22 per share, up six points or 37.5 percent from the initial public offering pricing of 16 per share.</p>
